<font color="#993322">

<table align='CENTER' cellpadding='2' border='1' cellspacing='2' background='http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif'><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=10&y=2002">This Month</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=9&y=2002">September-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=8&y=2002">August-2002</A></TD></TR><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=7&y=2002">July-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=6&y=2002">June-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=5&y=2002">May-2002</A></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><CENTER><font size=+2>July, 2002</font><BR></center><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>The Butterfly</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Wednesday - July 31st 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Our metamorphosis is almost complete.  I've had a bit of a break from web development and am now ready to get back to finishing up our site.  I'll be adding the capability to submit reports for Sanctioned Raid Leaders and will be filling in the point values for various items.  This means that Sanctioned Raids will be coming soon.
I'll be filling in the guild-bank system shortly after that.<BR><BR>
Also, if I haven't received any word from you by August first, you will need to apply to the guild as anyone else would if you seek membership.  Three and a half weeks should be plenty of time.<BR>
<BR>
If you have any questions or comments on these subjects, please feel free to post about them on our message boards.  I'll also be available in-game this evening for Gann's un-sanctioned Hate raid.  :></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>New Interface!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Thursday - July 25th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Welp, the new interface is out.  It's still in "extended beta" so it's optional for the moment.  You can read about some of the info on <a href="http://eq.castersrealm.com/viewarticle.asp?Article=4418" target="_CR">Casters Realm</A> for a while.<BR>
<BR>
While the new interface introduces some really nice features, it's a little difficult to get use to.  At least, it's difficult for someone who's been playing for 3 years hehe.  One of my big gripes is the lack of the /hitsmode command.  Sure, you can create a new chatwindow that filters ALL of the melee spam into one window, but it's not the same.  /hitsmode offered so much more versatility.<BR>
<BR>
There are a few other gripes about the interface (like having to reorganize the spellbooks), but it's not that bad.  For those interrested in a different look and feel for your EQ experience, you might check out <A href="http://newui.technosapien.net" target="_EQI">EQ Interface</A><BR>
<BR>
Just FYI.. like with many other major patches, they've re-incorporated several bugs that HAD been fixed.  There was a problem with mob HP being reported to the client that had been fixed.. it's back.  There use to be a problem where if you typed /camp desktop it would take you to server select that was fixed... it's back.  There were a couple others that are now back that I can't recall at this moment.  In any case, be wary of re-occuring problems.  (Like that one where you die just after getting a CH.. if that's back too)
</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Ulump Down, Bubben loot</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - July 22nd 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Gratz on your epic piece, Bubben :>  Only 2 more to go.</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Kael Mannor Squatted</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Tuesday - July 16th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'><A href="http://www.thelegionoflight.net/Page/Frameset.html" target="_LoL">Legion of Light</A>, led by Glamm, beat us to the manorhouse in Kael =/<BR>
Sorry Ninden.  Hopefully next time we'll find it un-camped.  Such is the case some times when we try to do raids in various areas.  You just have to hope that we get there before the other guys do :></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Reformed!!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Wednesday - July 10th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Legerdemain has been reformed under the same name! :><BR>
GM Rohadrim helped us out.  For a while, the former Leger's were members of "Rohadrim's Fan Club" hehe.  Former members of Legerdemain can feel free to send me or any of my alts a tell for re-invite.<BR>
And so it begins... :P~</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Giants and Fishmen Down!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - July 8th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>It's been a loooong time since I last submitted news!  I ought to start doing this more regularly.  

Anyway, we've been slapping together Phinny raids with people from other guilds.  I wasn't around for the first killing, but I saw that on the second killing (7/7/02) the guy in the orange robe coughed up a bard backbone and some minor items.  Very early this morning, we took the fishman down a third time, and what a haul he had:  wiz staff, mage staff, and a Kedge robe.  We're glad that one didn't get away.  I picked up the mage staff for Gann (he had to leave), and the other items went to some of the others who helped reel Phinny in.

I also attended one of the recent Kael outings that the guild put together.  We weren't there for long, but we did manage to score some phat lewt (more info on the message boards).

Special thanks to those who attended these events!</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:ultimaster@aol.com>Roldanious</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>New Look and Feel</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Sunday - July 7th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>The website has undergone a huge change!  Among those changes are a brand new set of rules, loot policies, and event structures.  We'll be reforming the guild under the new rules soon.<BR>
Some things that still need work:<BR>
The SRL event submition page.<BR>
The Point Values need to be filled in.<BR>
The guild bank system on-line needs to be completed.<BR></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>UDB Trak!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Tuesday - July 2nd 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Sorry for the late post on this hehe.  I was hoping to put together a nice set of screenshots, but I'm too lazy :><BR>
Deyna needs the Undead Bard to pop Trakanon in Sebilis.  Once he gets his butt whooped, Deyna will be all epic like.  Well, luckily, once you do the turn-in for this event, you get your piece back.  This means that if we were to fail, Deyna would not be SoL.<BR>
Well, we gathered up and insertion group and spent about 1.5 hours footing it down to check on UDB as per Deyna's post.  He was up!  Well, Roldanious had to camp out to remove a group bug before we could start CoH'ing people down.  Woops! When Rold logged back in, he found himself at the Sebilis Zone-IN!! OMG! Pos.. <BR>
We petitioned and promptly got the ~EQ bug? Naw.. it's a feature.  Live with it.~ response from the GM's.  There goes 1.5 hours.  At least we found out that the UDB was definatly up.  Deyna put together groups and we took the whole party down this time :><BR>
We got down there in a short time with no deaths.  A lot of grade-A peopel decided to come along to help.  All set-up and nervous, we gave Trak our first attempt ever as a guild.  SPLAT!! hehe<BR>
We didn't do tooo aweful badly.  Got him to 50%.  We had the forces to kill him, though short on tankage, but like I said, it was the first time for almost the entire raid force.  A lot of people were taken completely by suprise.<BR>
We're giving it another go this Sunday asuming the UDB is still up!  Check Deyna's posting in the Playground for details.</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>



</font>
